      "cooked": "<p>As I said in my other thread, I am only getting into the game now, got my enahanced edition, champing at the bit to get my housemates together to play, but in the mean time, I can't seem to find let's plays, or just stright forward \"battle reports\" for Sentinels. I play a lot of wargames, and watch a ton of batreps (just a ganme without the teaching aspect). I found a ton of \"How to\" videos, but is there anyone who actually just records their regular games and posts them?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>thanks :)</p>",
