      "created_at": "2018-08-22T22:07:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Handelabra's streams are definitely the best. Along with previews of new decks, there's plenty of strategy discussion, not to mention they pull off some crazy victories over the years. :D</p><p>I would be remiss if I didn't plug <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A5CYuUANZlg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">my own playthrough</a>, which was meant to introduce my channel followers to Sentinels Digital. :B The music's way loud, tho.</p>",
