      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-23T13:48:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's also worth bearing in mind that there are those of us who I'm sure wouldn't mind playing with you - some people own the Steam version of the game, some of us have Tabletop Sim...some of us have both. So consider that as an alternative whilst waiting for a chance to play face-to-face games with your friends - you can play online games with some of us :). We have a Discord server, if you haven't checked it out already, appropriately enough called the Realm of Discord - that's an easy way to have live conversations with fellow forum members and other fans of the game (also stuff like Spirit Island and other games published by &gt;G) :).</p>",
